@startuml
title CineSmart — Sequence Diagram: Recommendation & Atomic Reservation Separation

autonumber
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Customer / Group Organizer" as User
participant "React Frontend\n(SeatSelectionPage)" as UI
participant "GroupSeatingController" as RecController
participant "GroupSeatingService" as RecService
participant "SeatAllocationStrategy" as Strategy
participant "SeatScoringService" as Scorer
participant "BookingController" as BookController
participant "BookingService" as BookService
participant "ShowSeatRepository" as SeatRepo
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB

== Phase 3A: Recommendation Operation (Advisory, Non-Blocking) ==

User -> UI : Select Party Size (N=4), Preferred Tier (PREMIUM), "Find Best Seats"
activate UI

UI -> RecController : POST /api/shows/101/group-seating/recommendations\n{partySize: 4, preferredTier: "PREMIUM", allowSplitRows: true}
activate RecController

RecController -> RecService : getRecommendations(request)
activate RecService

RecService -> SeatRepo : findByShowId(101)
activate SeatRepo
SeatRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM show_seats WHERE show_id = 101
activate DB
DB --> SeatRepo : List<ShowSeat> (Inventory)
deactivate DB
SeatRepo --> RecService : List<ShowSeat>
deactivate SeatRepo

RecService -> Strategy : allocate(availableSeats, request, totalRows, totalCols)
activate Strategy
Strategy -> Scorer : scoreArrangement(windowSeats, CONTIGUOUS_ROW, ...)
activate Scorer
Scorer --> Strategy : ScoredArrangement(Score=96.5, rank=1)
deactivate Scorer
Strategy --> RecService : List<ScoredArrangement>
deactivate Strategy

RecService -> Scorer : getDeterministicComparator()
RecService -> RecService : Sort & Take Top 3 Distinct Candidates
RecService --> RecController : GroupSeatingResponseDTO
deactivate RecService

RecController --> UI : HTTP 200 OK (Top 3 Recommendations with Layout & Badges)
deactivate RecController

UI -> User : Render cards: Option #1 (96% Match, Row E 5-8)\nHighlights seats on SeatMap
deactivate UI

== Phase 3B: Customer Selection & Manual Verification ==

User -> UI : Reviews highlighted seats, clicks "Confirm Booking"
activate UI

== Phase 3C: Reservation Operation (Atomic Transaction & Concurrency Locking) ==

UI -> BookController : POST /api/bookings\n{showId: 101, showSeatIds: [1205, 1206, 1207, 1208]}
activate BookController

BookController -> BookService : createBooking(userEmail, request)
activate BookService

BookService -> BookService : Validate non-empty, non-duplicate, within size limit
BookService -> SeatRepo : findAllByIdWithLock([1205, 1206, 1207, 1208])
activate SeatRepo
SeatRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM show_seats WHERE id IN (...) FOR UPDATE
activate DB
note right of DB: Pessimistic write lock acquired.\nConcurrent transactions block.
DB --> SeatRepo : List<ShowSeat> (Locked entities)
deactivate DB
SeatRepo --> BookService : List<ShowSeat>
deactivate SeatRepo

BookService -> BookService : Validate status == AVAILABLE for all seats
BookService -> BookService : Transition status -> BOOKED for all seats
BookService -> SeatRepo : saveAll(selectedSeats)
BookService -> DB : INSERT INTO bookings, booking_seats
activate DB
DB --> BookService : Saved Booking Entity
deactivate DB

BookService --> BookController : BookingDTO (CONFIRMED)
deactivate BookService

BookController --> UI : HTTP 201 Created (Booking Reference CS-2026-XXXX)
deactivate BookController

UI -> User : Display "Booking Confirmed!" Success Dialog with Ticket Details
deactivate UI

@enduml
